This repository is the Bid Ladder **Company OS / Agent Office**, not the product app.

- Product code belongs in `tanviiiiir-r/rising-star-board` (DECISION-002). Never add application code here.
- Slack Bolt app belongs in `tanviiiiir-r/bid-ladder-slack` if DECISION-017 is approved. Do not create that repo or install Slack from this work.
- GitHub is the source of truth. Inspect remote state; do not assume files exist.
- Classify claims: FACT / HYPOTHESIS / ASSUMPTION / EXPERIMENT / DECISION.
- Do not fabricate decisions, prices, bids, credits, rewards, users, rankings, or citations.
- Founder approves merges. Never force-push or rewrite published history.
- Read `COMPANY.md`, `CEO.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and `AGENT_OFFICE.md` before acting.
